      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Mesh Texturization is disabled/bypassed by default. You can re-enable it using the Fast Groups Bypasser node from the rgthree-comfy extension.\n\nVRAM Requirements:\n\nPaint-v2-1 model (used for texturing): Requires 20 GB or more VRAM (recommended). Shape-v2-1 model: Requires 8 GB or more VRAM (recommended). The Paint-v2-1 model is much more demanding on VRAM than Shape-v2-1.\n\nModel Download Locations:\n\nPaint-v2-1 will be automatically downloaded to your system’s cache folder after your first generation. Shape-v2-1 must be manually placed in your ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models folder.\n\nRunpod Cloud GPU Template: \n\nIf you need more compute power, a Runpod template is available for this workflow. It will automatically download and install all required dependencies.Runpod offers a range of GPU options, including high-VRAM cards like the RTX 4090 (24 GB) and A100/H100 (up to 80 GB), with pay-as-you-go pricing.\n\nLink -  https://get.runpod.io/Hunyuan-3D-2-1-ComyUI"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
